# Living agent docs

When the user changes product rules, stack, or lasting conventions — update docs **in the same turn** as the code/fix. **Self-update** — do not wait for “add this to AGENTS” / “update the docs.” Chat must not be the only record.

| Kind | Where |
|------|--------|
| Product / game facts | `AGENTS.md` |
| How to edit code | `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` |
| Repeatable how-to | `.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md` |
| Soft prefs / rejected paths | `.cursor/skills/couch-potato/references/` |

Don’t duplicate the same paragraph into AGENTS + every rule — link or one-liner + pointer. Skip docs for trivial one-offs.

Knowledge map (topic → file): `.cursor/skills/couch-potato/SKILL.md`  
Skill checklist: `.cursor/skills/sync-agent-docs/SKILL.md`
